1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,200
KUCHING, 10 SECONDS AFTER EVERY OXYGEN ATOM DISAPPEARED.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,800
◀◀ REWIND

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,100
WHY? LET'S QUIZ EVERYTHING YOU CAN SEE.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:20,900
QUIZ 1/5 · How much of this window is oxygen, by mass?  5% / 25% / 53%
Answer: 53%
Glass is mostly silica, SiO₂. Oxygen is over half its weight.

5
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:31,900
QUIZ 2/5 · And this river water?  11% / 50% / 89%
Answer: 89%
In H₂O, one heavy oxygen outweighs two light hydrogens.

6
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:42,900
QUIZ 3/5 · How much of a person is oxygen, by mass?  20% / 65% / 90%
Answer: ~65%
Most of it sits in the water inside your cells.

7
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:53,900
QUIZ 4/5 · The ground under the city?  6% / 46% / 75%
Answer: 46%
Sand, clay, rock and concrete are mostly oxides.

8
00:00:53,900 --> 00:01:04,900
QUIZ 5/5 · The air you're breathing?  21% / 50% / 78%
Answer: 21%
Trick option: 78% is nitrogen, not oxygen.

9
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:08,300
SCORE YOURSELF. NOW REMOVE THE OXYGEN.

10
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:12,100
3 · 2 · 1

11
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:16,900
WINDOW → SILICON DUST
Take the O out of SiO₂ and glass falls apart.

12
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:21,910
RIVER → HYDROGEN GAS
Strip the O from H₂O and only a gas is left. It rises.

13
00:01:21,910 --> 00:01:27,310
PEOPLE → GAS BURST
About 7 kg of hydrogen each, squeezed past 1,000 atmospheres.

14
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:32,310
CONCRETE → POWDER
The oxides crumble. Steel frames are all that stand.

15
00:01:32,310 --> 00:01:37,110
AIR → 0.77 ATM
Thinner air, and nothing in it can burn.

16
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:40,510
THE SAME SECOND, ALL OVER EARTH.

17
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:46,110
≈30× — Ocean hydrogen vs today's air
Every sea turns into sky.

18
00:01:46,110 --> 00:01:50,910
−30% — Of earth's mass · ~24 moons
The planet survives. Smaller.

19
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:55,710
0.57% — Of the sun is oxygen
It keeps shining, and Earth keeps its orbit.

20
00:01:56,510 --> 00:02:02,910
WHICH ELEMENT SHOULD WE DELETE NEXT?

21
00:02:02,910 --> 00:02:06,510
COMMENT YOUR QUIZ SCORE.

